     A          R HGMENU
     A                                  1  2'Help - Games'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type 1, 2 or 3 and press Enter, or-
     A                                       put the cursor on a game and press'
     A                                  4  3'Enter.  Your record for each game -
     A                                      is shown below the list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HGGUESS
     A                                  1  2'Help - Guess the number'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type a number from 1 to 100 and pr-
     A                                      ess Enter.  You are told whether th-
     A                                      e'
     A                                  4  3'secret number is higher or lower. -
     A                                       Fewer tries is better.  F12 gives -
     A                                      up.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HGTTT
     A                                  1  2'Help - Tic-tac-toe'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'You are X and move first.  Put the-
     A                                       cursor on an empty square and pres-
     A                                      s'
     A                                  4  3'Enter, or type the number of the s-
     A                                      quare.  The computer answers as O.'
     A                                  6  3'The computer plays perfectly, so t-
     A                                      he best you can do is a draw.  It w-
     A                                      ill'
     A                                  7  3'win if you make a mistake.'
     A                                  9  3'F5 starts a new game.  F12 goes ba-
     A                                      ck.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HTETRIS
     A                                  1  2'Help - Tetris'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Fit the falling pieces together.  -
     A                                      A full row disappears and scores:'
     A                                  4  3'100 points for one row, 300 for tw-
     A                                      o, 500 for three and 800 for four.'
     A                                  6  3'F4 moves left, F5 moves right.  En-
     A                                      ter or F6 turns the piece.'
     A                                  7  3'F7 moves it down one row, F8 drops-
     A                                       it to the bottom.'
     A                                  9  3'A piece falls one row each second.-
     A                                        The game ends when there is no ro-
     A                                      om'
     A                                 10  3'for the next piece.  F9 starts a n-
     A                                      ew game and F3 leaves.'
     A                                 12  3'Your best score is kept and shown -
     A                                      on the games menu.'
     A                                 14  3'If pieces do not fall by themselve-
     A                                      s on your display, press Enter to l-
     A                                      et'
     A                                 15  3'time pass.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
